  "event-12505": {
    "title": "Hard Base Classic - #KeepHardstyleHardstyle - Stenk",
    "content": "<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs\">HARD BASE CLASSIC<br class=\"html-br\" />#KeepHardstyleHardstyle</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">On October 17 we return to the sound that made us fall in love with hardstyle back in the day. There is no genre detour on this night: from beginning to end it will be classic hardstyle only.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">The old melodies are coming back, along with the reverse bass, the euphoric anthems and the classic raw favourites – just the way we heard them at the parties back then.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\n<p>The venue will be the enclosed, winterised part of Stenk, so you don't have to worry about the October weather, and there will be no problem with the volume either.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t1/1/16/1f3a7.png\" alt=\"🎧\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Line-up:</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\n<p>Denoiser<br class=\"html-br\" />Siderunners<br class=\"html-br\" />Adam Bass<br class=\"html-br\" />Outragers<br class=\"html-br\" />ZnDo<br class=\"html-br\" />Dr Folli</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\n<p><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png\" alt=\"📅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> October 17, 2026<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png\" alt=\"⏰\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 23:00–05:00<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"📍\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Stenk – 1087 Budapest, Kerepesi út 9.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png\" alt=\"🎟️\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Ticket pre-sale starts on 4 September at 19:00 on the <a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"http://oneticket.hu/?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFsWFdDVWFUV0dMOXY1bWNKc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHvkzox5YUYChKl-s5ErA9ilbfD13DtYS2TMwbbwCW9VeAv7oqeel5efhDK9I_aem_NxZ0l5-ZjvwjN9MAPO247g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">oneticket.hu</a> site.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">\n<p>Hardstyle may change and evolve, but sometimes it is good to return to what truly made it hardstyle.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj xzsf02u x1s688f\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/keephardstylehardstyle?__cft__[0]=AZjvEUIuBqH_mnLWLvMhBzVoQ_tXnTYOXjx4J-OEHGRZM_uIXvR2YEecfOOVRXGLY5t_gh9PCWLulVFNIWrTkeh3JNjOH3ye8LVRV-zYR8424kGn0YTnQKoiwgzytuFsSd3n&amp;__tn__=q\">#KeepHardstyleHardstyle</a></div>\n",
